_action" href="/itxcomweb/es/en/group/our-approach">REVIEW OUR APPROACH</a></div></div></div><div class="gallery-grid margin__bottom__160 globalComponentContainer"><div class="grid columns--4 "><div class="grid__item d-flex justify-content-center itemG "><figure><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="930" height="1226" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="https://static.inditex.com/assets/public/53ac/6556/d0de44269656/901c8f2dc2bb/Grid_1_4/Grid_1_4.jpg?ts=1757430186319&amp;f=auto&amp;w={}"/></figure><figcaption></figcaption></div><div class="grid__item d-flex justify-content-center itemG "><figure><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="930" height="1226" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="https://static.inditex.com/assets/public/6091/a1d9/838f4215a105/fe6632f3f2ea/Grid_1_3/Grid_1_3.jpg?ts=1757430234270&amp;f=auto&amp;w={}"/></figure><figcaption></figcaption></div><div class="grid__item d-flex justify-content-center itemG "><figure><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="931" height="1226" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="https://static.inditex.com/assets/public/7a90/e6ed/1272455db01f/14ef5cc173e9/Grid_1_2/Grid_1_2.jpg?ts=1757430238703&amp;f=auto&amp;w={}"/></figure><figcaption></figcaption></div><div class="grid__item d-flex justify-content-center itemG "><figure><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="930" height="1226" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="https://static.inditex.com/assets/public/6078/ff8a/b1564c4d8266/01344c26e76f/Grid_1_1/Grid_1_1.jpg?ts=1757430242942&amp;f=auto&amp;w={}"/></figure><figcaption></figcaption></div></div></div><div class="text-cta  margin__bottom__160" style="background-color:transparent"><div class="text-cta__inner large" style="text-align:center;align-items:center"><div class="text-cta__animation"><div class="text-cta__content" style="text-align:center"><div><div><div style="text-align: center;"><h4>Inditex started with the ambition to make fashionable, quality and life-enhancing clothes for people. See how we’re working to bring beautiful, consciously-crafted fashion to everyone, everywhere.</h4></div>

</div></div></div></div><div class=""><a title="Go to Explore Our Commitments" aria-label="Go to Explore Our Commitments" class="text-cta__action" href="/itxcomweb/es/en/sustainability">Explore Our Commitments</a></div></div></div><div class="text-img-cta margin__bottom__160" id="text_image_cta_oyw4x"><div class=""><div class="text-img-cta__container-fluid is--bg-color" style="background-color:#F5F2EF"><div class="text-img-cta__boxcontent globalComponentContainer"><div class="text_img_cta_text_container text-img-cta__wrapper__box"><div class="text-img-cta__boxtext"><div class="text-img-cta__maintext"><h3>Together We Rise</h3><h5>A company can make things—but it takes a community to change things. We’ve made it our mission to ensure every member of our worldwide team feels seen, inspired, and empowered. Your Inditex career is more than a job—it’s a source of passion and endless possibility.</h5></div><div class="text_img_cta__ctaLink_container"><div class="text-img-cta__content-btn"><p class="text-img-cta__boxtext__btn"><a class="btn__link" target="" rel="" href="talent/life-at-inditex">LIFE AT INDITEX</a></p></div></div></div></div><div class="text-img-cta__boximage text-img-cta_animate__right text-img-cta__wrapper__box"><figure class="text-img-cta__single-img-container m-0 p-0"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="640" height="787" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="text-img-cta__single-img" style="color:transparent;aspect-ratio:4/5" src="https://static.inditex.com/assets/public/a918/5d77/902d470a9943/5fda4fd1eeaf/Home_Team/Home_Team.jpg?ts=1757430260749&amp;f=auto&amp;w={}"/></figure></div></div></div></div></div><div class="geco-list margin__bottom__160" id="list_13x2t" data-testid="list_13x2t"><div><div class="geco-list__recent-news-container geco-list__is--pc"><div class="geco-list__title--container"><div class="geco-list__title--text geco-list__title--animation"><h4>The Latest</h4></div></div><div class="geco-list__grid columns--3 geco-list__cards--animation" 